				"text": "{\n  \"inShort\": \"The slice is at risk: the devlog shows a mountain photo and a film thumbnail, not gameplay. References and a design board landed, but the playable slice and five-player testing remain unverified. Both members confirmed work, but Mia’s arrival adds no stated hours for tide and co-op sailing.\",\n  \"discussed\": [\n    {\n      \"itemId\": \"cmvtjvqa407chnxz8px563av7\",\n      \"text\": \"The public repository matches the task: Godot demos, an MIT license and import instructions. It supplies starting material, not evidence of the playable slice.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"itemId\": \"cmvtjvqc007cinxz8malbx2fr\",\n      \"text\": \"The animated reference video for the art style is recorded as done. The inspected title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny. The video was not watched, so the animated reference remains unverified. It does not demonstrate the reported tide or two-player boat.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"itemId\": \"cmvtjvqcw07cjnxz8pdhgkj7t\",\n      \"text\": \"The reference article on what playtesting is matches the task. It explains testing purposes and formats, but does not establish that five players tested the slice.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"itemId\": \"cmvtjvqds07cknxz8v6h3pm2y\",\n      \"text\": \"The private design board for the team is recorded as done with an attached artifact. No inspected contents were supplied, so its contribution to the slice is unknown.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notDiscussed\": [\n    \"cmvtjvqem07clnxz8as1uzyd7\"\n  ],\n  \"outsidePlan\": [],\n  \"questions\": [\n    \"Is there an openable build showing the reported tide loop and two-player boat?\",\n    \"What evidence establishes the second island and testing by five players?\"\n  ]\n}",
